1. WHAT YOU MAY DO

No prior permission is needed for any of the following, provided you comply
with Section 2 (Attribution) and Section 3 (Restrictions).

  a) USE. Install, run and play the Mod, privately or on any public or
     private game server. A server may accept donations toward its own
     running costs, but access to the Mod itself must never be sold or
     reserved for paying users.

  b) STUDY AND MODIFY. Read, modify and build upon the Mod for your own
     private use.

  c) CONTRIBUTE. Fork the repository and submit changes back to the Author
     as pull requests or patches. See Section 5.

  d) COMPATIBILITY AND ADD-ON MODS. Create and publicly distribute, free of
     charge, mods that interoperate with, extend, patch or bridge the Mod
     with other mods (for example "ZED+ x <other mod>"). Such a mod should
     depend on the Mod rather than bundle a copy of it, unless bundling is
     technically unavoidable.

  e) COLLECTIONS AND MODPACKS. Include the Mod in modpacks, collections or
     curated server lists, and redistribute it unmodified as part of them,
     free of charge. The Mod must be clearly credited as a separate work by
     the Author and must not be presented as a component authored by the
     pack maintainer.


2. ATTRIBUTION

Any distribution under 1(d) or 1(e), and any public presentation of work
derived from the Mod, must credit "ZED+ by Seah (SeahDokki)" visibly, and
link back to the official repository or Workshop page. Existing copyright
notices, credits and this License file must be preserved intact.


3. RESTRICTIONS

  a) NO CLAIMING AUTHORSHIP. You may not claim to be the author or
     co-author of the Mod, present it as your own work, republish it under a
     different name or author, or remove, obscure or alter its credits.

  b) NO SELLING. You may not sell, license, rent, sublicense, or otherwise
     commercially exploit the Mod or any part of it, and you may not place
     it behind a paywall, a subscription, a donation requirement, a
     monetised early-access tier, or any comparable arrangement. This
     applies equally to the Mod on its own and to the Mod bundled with
     anything else. The Author reserves all commercial rights exclusively.

  c) NO RELICENSING. You may not sublicense the Mod or distribute it under
     different terms. Work covered by Section 1(d) or 1(e) that includes any
     part of the Mod remains governed by this License.

  d) NO AI-GENERATED ASSETS. See Section 4.


4. AI-GENERATED CONTENT

Generative AI may be used to assist with Code, and this expressly includes
translation files: machine-translated strings are acceptable, though a review
by a speaker of the language is preferred where one is available.

Generative AI may not be used to produce Assets. Every image, texture,
sprite, icon, model, animation, sound and piece of music distributed with the
Mod, or contributed to it, must be authored by a human or lawfully sourced
from a human-authored work. Contributions containing AI-generated Assets will
be rejected, and their inclusion is a breach of this License.


